@@ -9,14 +9,14 @@ This rule looks for tabs anywhere inside a file: code, comments or anything else
 Examples of **incorrect** code for this rule:

 ```js
-var a /t= 2;
+var a \t= 2;

 /**
-* /t/t it's a test function
+* \t\t it's a test function
 */
 function test(){}

-var x = 1; // /t test
